{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Gor-eal","id":"859432639681134592","is_bot":0,"username":"gorealthundhal"},"author_id":"859432639681134592","channel_id":"864400995865460746","content":"Johnathan drops off a copy of his letter to the king at your airship then takes his leave.","created_at":"2021-07-16T04:07:09.779000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865444423655358495","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"StarPilot94","id":"468162764586876949","is_bot":0,"username":"starpilot94"},"author_id":"468162764586876949","channel_id":"864400995865460746","content":"4:01 am - As she enters her ship, she spots the letter. She takes the time to read it. She then pulled the note close to her chest, taking in a breath of air. She then set it safely in her quarters.\n\n4:06 am - After setting the note down, she washed off and tidied up. Lighting the incense for a little while, she did several prayers, and prepared herself for sleep.\n\n4:13 am - She crawled into bed, after putting the incense out. She pulled the covers up, and couldn’t shake the feeling that she was going down a path she shouldn’t follow. But.. it felt right. She needed someone in her life. She needed answers to her past. She wanted it. Eventually, she fell asleep…","created_at":"2021-07-16T11:15:14.886000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865552154802782218","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
