{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"StarPilot94","id":"468162764586876949","is_bot":0,"username":"starpilot94"},"author_id":"468162764586876949","channel_id":"864400995865460746","content":"Secel was in a mood. Still is, in a way. That.. crush feeling. The feeling of not wanting to get out of bed which distracts from thinking about that someone. \n\nShe didn’t know *why*, but she just wanted to.. She pinched herself to keep herself awake. Besides cleaning her clothes and doing some small bit of work around the ship, she laid in her bed, in a state of comfort.\n\nBut.. if he did come… “Stop it.” she told herself. “You’re acting like a school girl. Take time with this.”","created_at":"2021-07-17T04:58:56.920000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865819843813965834","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"864400995865460746","content":"Kukudh, in pigeon form, knocks a few times with their beak.","created_at":"2021-07-17T08:26:56.442000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865872186723401749","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"StarPilot94","id":"468162764586876949","is_bot":0,"username":"starpilot94"},"author_id":"468162764586876949","channel_id":"864400995865460746","content":"She rolls over, her smile breaking out. She then hopped up and rushed to go on her date with her- \n\n“Oh.. hello bird.” She said, her smile fading.","created_at":"2021-07-17T08:29:11.850000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865872754665979935","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"864400995865460746","content":"'Oh, apologies - are we interrupting something?' Sabrine's voice echoes from Kukudh.","created_at":"2021-07-17T08:31:28.260000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865873326810202122","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"864400995865460746","content":"'I'm waiting to talk to someone, and thought I would send Kukudh to check on people.'","created_at":"2021-07-17T08:31:57.198000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865873448186282024","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"StarPilot94","id":"468162764586876949","is_bot":0,"username":"starpilot94"},"author_id":"468162764586876949","channel_id":"864400995865460746","content":"“Oh, no. Not at all. Please, come in.” She gestured for Kukudh to follow her as she walked back to her quarters and climbed back in bed after checking on her drying clothes.","created_at":"2021-07-17T08:33:45.475000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865873902331887626","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"864400995865460746","content":"Kukudh follows and perches themselves somewhere. 'So how are you holding up?'","created_at":"2021-07-17T08:34:31.472000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865874095257288714","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"StarPilot94","id":"468162764586876949","is_bot":0,"username":"starpilot94"},"author_id":"468162764586876949","channel_id":"864400995865460746","content":"She thinks for a bit, then rolls over onto her side. “I.. think I might be in love…”","created_at":"2021-07-17T08:35:17.997000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865874290398199819","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"864400995865460746","content":"'...you too, huh?'","created_at":"2021-07-17T08:35:44.661000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865874402233942026","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"864400995865460746","content":"'But can the dead even love? ...no, never mind that. I'll ask the Mender when I can. Want to talk about it?'","created_at":"2021-07-17T08:36:17.638000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865874540550946817","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"StarPilot94","id":"468162764586876949","is_bot":0,"username":"starpilot94"},"author_id":"468162764586876949","channel_id":"864400995865460746","content":"“First of all, of course you can! Why wouldn’t you be able too?” She then smiled, and nodded. “Guess who it is.”","created_at":"2021-07-17T08:39:07.899000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865875254676815883","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"864400995865460746","content":"'I forget his name offhand, my mind is sort of... misty... but... that veteran, perhaps? Who helped in the sewers that one time?'","created_at":"2021-07-17T08:40:50.681000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865875685775507506","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"StarPilot94","id":"468162764586876949","is_bot":0,"username":"starpilot94"},"author_id":"468162764586876949","channel_id":"864400995865460746","content":"“Tall, handsome, and perfect?” She let out a sigh as she laid back on the bed, then in that cliche way; “Yes..”","created_at":"2021-07-17T08:43:09.450000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865876267814617138","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"864400995865460746","content":"'I remember you being particularly comfortable talking to him, so.'","created_at":"2021-07-17T08:43:09.685000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865876268801327134","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"864400995865460746","content":"Kukudh makes a gesture akin to a shrug. 'Perfection takes many forms. I respect him for his help, and I hope things go well for you.'","created_at":"2021-07-17T08:45:06.403000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865876758350659604","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"864400995865460746","content":"'I... suppose you were expecting him rather than me?'","created_at":"2021-07-17T08:45:57.447000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865876972445892608","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"StarPilot94","id":"468162764586876949","is_bot":0,"username":"starpilot94"},"author_id":"468162764586876949","channel_id":"864400995865460746","content":"She moves her head to look at Kukudh. The smile on her face even more pronounced. “Well, we were supposed to have a meal, but that got postponed.. again…” Her lips turned into a frown.","created_at":"2021-07-17T08:46:55.053000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865877214061658133","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"864400995865460746","content":"they nod in sympathy. 'Perhaps he is busy, or delayed. He does not seem the type to just not show up.'","created_at":"2021-07-17T08:48:02.529000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865877497077694484","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"864400995865460746","content":"'The city requires a lot of work, I would not be surprised if he were helping out with it somehow.'","created_at":"2021-07-17T08:48:23.753000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865877586097471489","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"StarPilot94","id":"468162764586876949","is_bot":0,"username":"starpilot94"},"author_id":"468162764586876949","channel_id":"864400995865460746","content":"She tugged at her lower lip with her teeth. “I should be with him…”","created_at":"2021-07-17T08:49:07.689000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865877770378543124","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"864400995865460746","content":"'I understand your feelings. I too want to help my... friend... but I am not sure what I can do.'\nKukudh then adds in their own voice, `Yeah, she got those noodle arms!`","created_at":"2021-07-17T08:51:36.085000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865878392796610561","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"StarPilot94","id":"468162764586876949","is_bot":0,"username":"starpilot94"},"author_id":"468162764586876949","channel_id":"864400995865460746","content":"She let out a giggle. “Hey, I’ve been here all day daydreaming about a crush, so i’m probably doing worse then you right now.”","created_at":"2021-07-17T08:53:45.383000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865878935112122368","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"864400995865460746","content":"'I've only been... awake? Active? Not resting, for a short time, but. It is strange, I remember very little of the hours before I rested.'","created_at":"2021-07-17T08:55:10.112000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865879290489995304","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"864400995865460746","content":"'All I remember is that Kukudh had gone to check on him, and brought me back a message and a berry... and a little advice, which I have been meditating on.'","created_at":"2021-07-17T08:55:49.250000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865879454647451648","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"StarPilot94","id":"468162764586876949","is_bot":0,"username":"starpilot94"},"author_id":"468162764586876949","channel_id":"864400995865460746","content":"“Oh?” At this she fully rolled over onto her side. “What advice is this?”","created_at":"2021-07-17T08:57:27.666000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865879867434467358","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"864400995865460746","content":"'Something about... If someone is truly worthy of you, they will not force you into becoming a different person. It... may not apply to a corpse, but to everyone else?'","created_at":"2021-07-17T09:00:20.797000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865880593597857822","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"StarPilot94","id":"468162764586876949","is_bot":0,"username":"starpilot94"},"author_id":"468162764586876949","channel_id":"864400995865460746","content":"She frowned and propped herself up on her elbow. “You’re still alive Sabrine. Yes it applies to you. Trust me.” She gestured with a hand to herself. “I’m a Tiefling. Am I not a person?”","created_at":"2021-07-17T09:03:38.433000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865881422543716355","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"864400995865460746","content":"'You are a person, definitely. But you were born with this body. I... don't know how much of mine truly belongs to me.' Kukudh absentmindedly rubs a wing at their neck.","created_at":"2021-07-17T09:05:08.970000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865881802282500096","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"StarPilot94","id":"468162764586876949","is_bot":0,"username":"starpilot94"},"author_id":"468162764586876949","channel_id":"864400995865460746","content":"She sighs and sits up, instinctually pulling the sheet around her like a blanket. “Sabrine, I have Fiend ties in my blood. There are a lot of people who would view you as more of a person then me. Trust me, you *are* one.”","created_at":"2021-07-17T09:09:28.098000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865882889144107008","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
